  "question": {
    "text": "If the sixth term in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>8</mn></msup></math> is <math><mn>5600</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of <math><mi>x</mi></math> is"
  },
